/u/liqinliqin", "website": "www.doit.am", "twitter": "", "psn": "", "github": "smartarduino", "btc": "", "location": "深圳", "tagline": "www.doit.am", "bio": "机器人、物联网", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/80d4/c0e3/23618_mini.png?m=1786078249", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/80d4/c0e3/23618_normal.png?m=1786078249", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/80d4/c0e3/23618_large.png?m=1786078249", "created": 1342575715, "last_modified": 1786078249, "pro": 1786330904}, "last_reply_by": "imruiming", "last_touched": 1786328440, "title": "昨天一天用 Codex 5.6 Sol 搞定的，基于 ESP32-C5 WiFi CSI 睡眠监测，经过一夜的睡眠监测，确实很准", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1233022", "created": 1786248771, "deleted": 0, "content": "昨天一天用 Codex 5.6 Sol 搞定的，基于 ESP32-C5 WiFi CSI 睡眠监测，经过一夜的睡眠监测，确实很准啊。\r\n\r\nAI 算法能力已经超过博士了，我看了下代码和思路，和我当年读博的思路基本一致，在算法和实现上比我当时的强。\r\n\r\n![]( https://i.v2ex.co/090cUeHs.png)\r\n\r\n![]( https://i.v2ex.co/HfZu99Ga.jpeg)", "content_rendered": "<p>昨天一天用 Codex 5.6 Sol 搞定的，基于 ESP32-C5 WiFi CSI 睡眠监测，经过一夜的睡眠监测，确实很准啊。</p>\n<p>AI 算法能力已经超过博士了，我看了下代码和思路，和我当年读博的思路基本一致，在算法和实现上比我当时的强。</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://i.v2ex.co/090cUeHs.png\"/></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://i.v2ex.co/HfZu99Ga.jpeg\"/></p>\n", "last_modified": 1786248771, "replies": 44, "id": 1233022}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_large.png?m=1777132346", "name": "qna", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_normal.png?m=1777132346", "title": "问与答", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/qna", "topics": 240607, "footer": "", "header": "<!--\r\n一个更好的世界需要你持续地提出好问题。\r\n-->", "title_alternative": "Questions and Answers", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_mini.png?m=1777132346", "stars": 4505, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 12, "parent_node_name": "v2ex"}, "member": {"id": 319660, "username": "052678", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/052678", "website": "", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3824/6f0d/319660_mini.png?m=1783931668", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3824/6f0d/319660_normal.png?m=1783931668", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3824/6f0d/319660_large.png?m=1783931668", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3824/6f0d/319660_xlarge.png?m=1783931668", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3824/6f0d/319660_xxlarge.png?m=1783931668", "avatar_xxxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3824/6f0d/319660_xxxlarge.png?m=1783931668", "created": 1527742385, "last_modified": 1783931668, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "chunqicoder", "last_touched": 1786266678, "title": "减肥真的不难啊，为什么要靠打药这种方式呢？", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1233124", "created": 1786324278, "deleted": 0, "content": "本人从 100 斤增肌到了 145 斤，171 的身高。然后从 145 斤减脂掉到了 130 斤的标准体重。还把抽了八年的烟戒掉了。一路看来真不难，坚持下就行。我看社区里还有打什么替尔泊肽的（我不懂这药，我的认知里觉得是药三分毒，真没必要）。我的朋友圈中还有动手术吸脂的。真的，减肥真那么难? 管住嘴、迈开腿。一咬牙就过来了。减肥、戒烟这种事情真的是你能控制、最容易的事情了", "content_rendered": "<p>本人从 100 斤增肌到了 145 斤，171 的身高。然后从 145 斤减脂掉到了 130 斤的标准体重。还把抽了八年的烟戒掉了。一路看来真不难，坚持下就行。我看社区里还有打什么替尔泊肽的（我不懂这药，我的认知里觉得是药三分毒，真没必要）。我的朋友圈中还有动手术吸脂的。真的，减肥真那么难? 管住嘴、迈开腿。一咬牙就过来了。减肥、戒烟这种事情真的是你能控制、最容易的事情了</p>\n", "last_modified": 1786324278, "replies": 44, "id": 1233124}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6cdd/60ea/184_large.png?m=1630643913", "name": "apple", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6cdd/60ea/184_normal.png?m=1630643913", "title": "Apple", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/apple", "topics": 30946, "footer": "", "header": "设计了 <a href=\"/go/watch\">Apple Watch</a>，<a href=\"/go/ipad\">iPad</a>，<a href=\"/go/iphone\">iPhone</a>，<a href=\"/go/imac\">iMac</a> 及 <a href=\"/go/mbp\">MacBook Pro</a> 等电子产品的美国公司。", "title_alternative": "Apple"